  "body": "I get the following error message when trying to generate a config file:\n\n```\nstefan@Stefans-MBP:~/.synapse$ python -m synapse.app.homeserver -c homeserver.yaml --generate-config --server-name=stefanmatrix\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/System/Library/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/2.7/lib/python2.7/runpy.py\", line 162, in _run_module_as_main\n    \"__main__\", fname, loader, pkg_name)\n  File \"/System/Library/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/2.7/lib/python2.7/runpy.py\", line 72, in _run_code\n    exec code in run_globals\n  File \"/Users/stefan/Library/Python/2.7/lib/python/site-packages/synapse/app/homeserver.py\", line 36, in <module>\n    from synapse.crypto import context_factory\n  File \"/Users/stefan/Library/Python/2.7/lib/python/site-packages/synapse/crypto/context_factory.py\", line 17, in <module>\n    from twisted.internet._sslverify import _OpenSSLECCurve, _defaultCurveName\nImportError: cannot import name _OpenSSLECCurve\n```\n",
